# Private planning notes and internal documentation. Never committed.
# No trailing slash on these three: a secondary checkout may hold them as symlinks back to the
# main one, and `docs/` matches a directory but not a symlink to one — so with the slash they
# showed as untracked and `git add -A` would have committed the private notes.
